# Local development database (BLK-001 workaround; PGlite persisted to disk).
# Any directory, not just the default: a dogfooding run with its own
# KYNVIORA_LOCAL_DB_DIR once put 1,277 PGlite pages into a commit.
.kynviora-data/
.kynviora-*/

# Generated native projects (Expo CNG). `npx expo prebuild` regenerates them from
# `app.json`, so a committed copy is a second source of truth that drifts from the
# config plugins - including the SQLCipher one, whose whole effect is a generated
# `gradle.properties` line.
apps/mobile/android/
apps/mobile/ios/

# The session transcript pasted in for a resume. Not project documentation.
docs/autonomy/last_session_messeges.md

# Working output from the device harnesses and from verification runs: logs, screenshots and
# hierarchy dumps written when a check could not proceed (`scripts/device/ui.ts`). Evidence about
# one run on one emulator, which is not project content.
scratchpad/
